      "raw": "[quote=\"much0gust0\"]\n\nWelp, been playing THIS one wrong...it does say &quot;all,&quot; though...\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou have to think of it as a triggered ability. It activates when the &quot;When&quot; condition is met. In this case, &quot;When you make an attack.&quot; Basically, you roll, this triggers, you take all the automisses and reroll them. The ability doesn&#39;t trigger again on the reroll, so you&#39;re stuck with it.\n",
